places.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFej7h5iJ4TBzFulnNKclKtFsRzGdx85vaMXGW7idqXtFnpGBPtGp89Y-2QE5C0DCrEofpANgy11NIla_I1GPssh-MTp5f18ZgsRSauXYKdl4PU7m8tOVUxcLM7eCEEB7Y=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"**Physics and Engineering:**\\n*   **Archimedes' Principle:** His most famous discovery is the principle of buoyancy, which states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQZvtVlHlOFHw-9pXfGBFCN26jhLQBALnSH3607Sr9jCH8t96SEL8F7tJ0VFaZYjqiYCFEjMvBp-V8pC6TpnlIgnuEPsmvPGFXjX7d3SKZeQgL2j66upHyVofKBxNhz8MFHw==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Legend has it he discovered this while in the bath and ran through the streets naked shouting \\\"Eureka!\\\" (\\\"I have found it!\\\").\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKWP0BP13gktuK0wm4BOpFqPB3AqbxIlUUgheD_OrKBr7VeJGL6_2tSR-P8nNhPm9Art8vpQS0CP_M3u1Df-edpymAKCpS_Z6mNcnnFVwnBHv96tO4AdFbUYauWhjvmSWzmkFxFgZQ4Yex\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided a mathematical proof for the law of the lever and is credited with the quote, \\\"Give me a place to stand, and I will move the Earth.\\\" He also developed systems of pulleys to move heavy objects with smaller forces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFej7h5iJ4TBzFulnNKclKtFsRzGdx85vaMXGW7idqXtFnpGBPtGp89Y-2QE5C0DCrEofpANgy11NIla_I1GPssh-MTp5f18ZgsRSauXYKdl4PU7m8tOVUxcLM7eCEEB7Y=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This invention is a device for raising water, which is still used today for irrigation and in sewage treatment plants.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDDGoXp3vax0PpWzFXrkAuJkvjtjGzmtXJlVDSAFmLr3oFXtjKfCYYV8uhGUA8gmAKHRqE5MrwWkiJwSW5mjbNyJhMCqvFs7xY6c-PulYGkEhIFsC1qmCLhBMcLQgimhcHti4MLlxjn0gs-PVbfm9ANBhmCwPd\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"thoughtco.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This invention is a device for raising water, which is still used today for irrigation and in sewage treatment plants.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4vdqG9raMqysmE6oM-6H1DUfcJS-1gLvepbPXHWMkZgdptmoZMThwZb9Do6XhXzPTwojkgZbKZbb5fzjP7hqGvRYoOnsvfVyaRsr_gI8b2Q6eQQTh7CJtnCZRIqfpW4UiIRu9dGDBjtk6WcceL7QI4jJbFQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"thoughtco.com\",\"data\":\"It consists of a screw-shaped surface inside a pipe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4vdqG9raMqysmE6oM-6H1DUfcJS-1gLvepbPXHWMkZgdptmoZMThwZb9Do6XhXzPTwojkgZbKZbb5fzjP7hqGvRYoOnsvfVyaRsr_gI8b2Q6eQQTh7CJtnCZRIqfpW4UiIRu9dGDBjtk6WcceL7QI4jJbFQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"These included catapults, cranes to drop rocks, and claws to lift ships out of the water.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDDGoXp3vax0PpWzFXrkAuJkvjtjGzmtXJlVDSAFmLr3oFXtjKfCYYV8uhGUA8gmAKHRqE5MrwWkiJwSW5mjbNyJhMCqvFs7xY6c-PulYGkEhIFsC1qmCLhBMcLQgimhcHti4MLlxjn0gs-PVbfm9ANBhmCwPd\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"thoughtco.com\",\"data\":\"He is also said to have devised a system of mirrors to set enemy ships on fire, though the efficacy of this \\\"heat ray\\\" is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4vdqG9raMqysmE6oM-6H1DUfcJS-1gLvepbPXHWMkZgdptmoZMThwZb9Do6XhXzPTwojkgZbKZbb5fzjP7hqGvRYoOnsvfVyaRsr_gI8b2Q6eQQTh7CJtnCZRIqfpW4UiIRu9dGDBjtk6WcceL7QI4jJbFQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Odometer:** He is credited with designing an early version of an odometer to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFej7h5iJ4TBzFulnNKclKtFsRzGdx85vaMXGW7idqXtFnpGBPtGp89Y-2QE5C0DCrEofpANgy11NIla_I1GPssh-MTp5f18ZgsRSauXYKdl4PU7m8tOVUxcLM7eCEEB7Y=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"thoughtco.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Odometer:** He is credited with designing an early version of an odometer to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4vdqG9raMqysmE6oM-6H1DUfcJS-1gLvepbPXHWMkZgdptmoZMThwZb9Do6XhXzPTwojkgZbKZbb5fzjP7hqGvRYoOnsvfVyaRsr_gI8b2Q6eQQTh7CJtnCZRIqfpW4UiIRu9dGDBjtk6WcceL7QI4jJbFQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"It is believed he studied in Alexandria, Egypt, a major center of learning in the ancient world, before returning to his native Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDDGoXp3vax0PpWzFXrkAuJkvjtjGzmtXJlVDSAFmLr3oFXtjKfCYYV8uhGUA8gmAKHRqE5MrwWkiJwSW5mjbNyJhMCqvFs7xY6c-PulYGkEhIFsC1qmCLhBMcLQgimhcHti4MLlxjn0gs-PVbfm9ANBhmCwPd\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"It is believed he studied in Alexandria, Egypt, a major center of learning in the ancient world, before returning to his native Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQZvtVlHlOFHw-9pXfGBFCN26jhLQBALnSH3607Sr9jCH8t96SEL8F7tJ0VFaZYjqiYCFEjMvBp-V8pC6TpnlIgnuEPsmvPGFXjX7d3SKZeQgL2j66upHyVofKBxNhz8MFHw==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"He was known to be so engrossed in his work that he would often forget to eat.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDDGoXp3vax0PpWzFXrkAuJkvjtjGzmtXJlVDSAFmLr3oFXtjKfCYYV8uhGUA8gmAKHRqE5MrwWkiJwSW5mjbNyJhMCqvFs7xY6c-PulYGkEhIFsC1qmCLhBMcLQgimhcHti4MLlxjn0gs-PVbfm9ANBhmCwPd\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"A Roman soldier reportedly killed him after he refused to leave his mathematical work.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKWP0BP13gktuK0wm4BOpFqPB3AqbxIlUUgheD_OrKBr7VeJGL6_2tSR-P8nNhPm9Art8vpQS0CP_M3u1Df-edpymAKCpS_Z6mNcnnFVwnBHv96tO4AdFbUYauWhjvmSWzmkFxFgZQ4Yex\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"The Roman general, Marcus Claudius Marcellus, had admired Archimedes for his inventions and regretted his death.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKWP0BP13gktuK0wm4BOpFqPB3AqbxIlUUgheD_OrKBr7VeJGL6_2tSR-P8nNhPm9Art8vpQS0CP_M3u1Df-edpymAKCpS_Z6mNcnnFVwnBHv96tO4AdFbUYauWhjvmSWzmkFxFgZQ4Yex\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"As per his request, his tomb was marked with a sphere enclosed in a cylinder to commemorate his favorite mathematical proof.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDDGoXp3vax0PpWzFXrkAuJkvjtjGzmtXJlVDSAFmLr3oFXtjKfCYYV8uhGUA8gmAKHRqE5MrwWkiJwSW5mjbNyJhMCqvFs7xY6c-PulYGkEhIFsC1qmCLhBMcLQgimhcHti4MLlxjn0gs-PVbfm9ANBhmCwPd\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"His inventions and mathematical principles have remained influential for millennia, solidifying his reputation as a foundational figure in the history of science.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQZvtVlHlOFHw-9pXfGBFCN26jhLQBALnSH3607Sr9jCH8t96SEL8F7tJ0VFaZYjqiYCFEjMvBp-V8pC6TpnlIgnuEPsmvPGFXjX7d3SKZeQgL2j66upHyVofKBxNhz8MFHw==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"02408e1c-06dc-407d-848b-49edd70015a1\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758889733,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":823,\"prompt_tokens\":5,\"total_tokens\":828}}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
